78
00:06:14,120 --> 00:06:19,120
This is a good approximation of the ladies' algorithm as it gets expensive to execute

79
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:24,640
in hardware if the associativity, aka the number of ways, is high.

80
00:06:24,640 --> 00:06:28,880
A practical approximation of LRU is not most recently used.

81
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:33,600
The idea here is to track the most recently used and then evict any one of the others

82
00:06:33,600 --> 00:06:35,100
