83
00:06:35,100 --> 00:06:47,160
It actually turns out that this performs well in most applications.

84
00:06:47,160 --> 00:06:50,240
Let's walk through an example with LRU replacement.

85
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:54,240
Here's a 32-byte cache with an associativity of two.

86
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:59,880
