104
00:08:11,400 --> 00:08:16,360
The same goes for 2-0, this time with set0.

105
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:18,840
Now the program accesses 3-3.

106
00:08:18,840 --> 00:08:24,320
This block also falls into set0, but since our cache is 2-way associative, we don't

107
